    <!-- EN: joinerEnding-&gt;You'll be able to direct [lodgersDef] the same way you direct your own colonists.[specialNeedsExplanation] -->
    <li>joinerEnding-&gt;Vocês poderão comandar [lodgersDef] do mesmo jeito que comandam os próprios colonos.[specialNeedsExplanation]</li>
    <!-- EN: specialNeedsExplanation(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,priority=1)-&gt; You'll need to satisfy any special royal needs the [lodgersLabelPlural] may have. -->
    <li>specialNeedsExplanation(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,priority=1)-&gt; Vocês vão precisar atender às necessidades reais especiais que os [lodgersLabelPlural] tiverem.</li>
    <!-- EN: specialNeedsExplanation-&gt; -->
    <li>specialNeedsExplanation-&gt;</li>
    <!-- EN: theirHisHer(nobleCount==1)-&gt;[lodgers0_possessive] -->
    <li>theirHisHer(nobleCount==1)-&gt;[lodgers0_possessive]</li>
